<h1>Fixing slow pages, starting with the biggest win</h1>
<p class="dek">Slow pages lose readers before they read a word. Where the time usually goes, and what to fix first.</p>
<div class="post-meta">
<address>
<ul class="people" role="list" aria-label="Written by">
<li class="person"><span><a rel="author" href="/blog/authors/lena-vogt/">Lena Vogt</a><span class="person-role">Technical SEO editor</span></span></li>
</ul>
</address>
<p class="post-date">Published <time datetime="2026-10-05">5 October 2026</time></p>
</div>
<div class="rs-strip">
<div class="score-meter">
<p class="score-tile"><span class="visually-hidden">Score </span>8.5<span class="visually-hidden"> out of 10</span></p>
